  "notes": "These candidate mappings use exact IEEE 1516.1-2025 C++ API declarations and their canonical clause labels. The scenario queries two adapter-supplied attributes with different ownership states, checks the exact federate-owned and unowned callback partitions, confirms the ordinary unowned attribute is not classified as RTI-owned, and verifies that the query does not change ownership. It does not cover RTI-owned MOM attributes, invalid handles, callback/removal races, save/restore, or full conformance.",
